<title>JAPAN: Key 182nd 10-year JGB yield up sharply in Tokyo.</title>
<headline>Key 182nd 10-year JGB yield up sharply in Tokyo.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The yield of the key 182nd cash Japanese government bond (JGB) surged to hit 2.600 percent in early morning trade in Tokyo on Thursday from Wednesday's 2.50 percent.</p>
<p>The key December JGB futures contract was also down sharply, falling as low as 124.74. Wednesday's close was 125.60.</p>
